; SMB audit (needs the smbuser password, once per handler): a tree walk with
; more directories open than the handler has listing slots - old handler on
; PS1:, fixed one on PS9:. pn-audit/A has 40 entries, A/B 40, A/B/C.
FailAt 21
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
Wait 6
Mount DH0:PrismNet/smb/PS1
Mount DH0:PrismNet/smb/PS9
Echo "start" >DH0:PrismNet/smblist.log
Echo "==== OLD handler: List A ALL (should end after 80 files + 2 dirs)" >>DH0:PrismNet/smblist.log
Run >NIL: Execute DH0:PrismNet/t-smblist-old
Wait 90
Echo "---- after 90 s" >>DH0:PrismNet/smblist.log
Echo "==== NEW handler" >>DH0:PrismNet/smblist.log
List PS9:pn-audit/A ALL >DH0:PrismNet/smblist-new.log
Echo "new: list returned" >>DH0:PrismNet/smblist.log
Echo "DONE" >>DH0:PrismNet/smblist.log
